<title>USA: Oneida Ltd to acquire THC Systems.</title>
<headline>Oneida Ltd to acquire THC Systems.</headline>
<dateline>ONEIDA, N.Y. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oneida Ltd said on Thursday that it has agreed to buy substantially all the assets and assume certain liabilities of THC Systems Inc, which operates as Rego China, for $45 million.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be completed by the end of the year, said Oneida Chairman and Chief Executive Officer William D. Matthews.</p>
<p>THC is a leading importer and marketer of commercial vitreous china and porcelain for the foodservice industry in the United States, Oneida said.</p>
</text>
